===
ble
===

This machine handles all ble work.

When only the id of the peer device is known, 
we must scan for it.

When the ble address information and the next expected 
communications window are known,
a more targeted search can be done.




This machine implements parent machine translator grab_ble_comm, translating parent event ble_comm.

